{"id":"dvesti","lemma":"двести","pos":"num","rank":2962,"glosses":["two hundred (200)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2a/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"В комнате было двести человек.","en":"There were two hundred people in the room.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"person"}]},{"text":"Я заплатил за эту сумку двести долларов.","en":"I paid $200 for this bag.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to pay","l":"заплатить"},{"g":"behind / for"},null,null,null,null]},{"text":"Двести долларов — вот всё, что нам было нужно.","en":"Two hundred dollars was all we needed.","words":[null,null,{"g":"here is"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"it is necessary"}]},{"text":"Я купил книгу за двести иен.","en":"I bought a book for two hundred yen.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to buy, to purchase","l":"купить"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},null,null]},{"text":"Это деревня в двести жителей.","en":"It's a village of two hundred inhabitants.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"village, hamlet"},{"g":"in"},null,null]}]}